      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Dos diosas protegían a los vivos: una con amor, y la otra con furia.",
          "en": "Two goddesses protected the living: one with love, and one with fury."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hathor era la diosa de la música, la alegría y las madres. Se la dibuja con orejas de vaca.",
          "en": "Hathor was the goddess of music, joy, and mothers. She is drawn with the ears of a cow."
        },
        {
          "es": "Sekhmet, 'la Poderosa', tenía cabeza de leona. Traía la guerra y las plagas, pero también curaba.",
          "en": "Sekhmet, 'the Powerful One', had a lioness's head. She brought war and plague, but she also healed."
        },
        {
          "es": "En un mito famoso, eran dos caras de la misma diosa: el Ojo de Ra.",
          "en": "In one famous myth, they were two faces of the same goddess: the Eye of Ra."
        }
      ],
